cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use OpenVeil, please cite it as below. An arXiv preprint describing
  OpenVeil is forthcoming; this file will be updated with its reference when
  it is available. No DOI has been assigned yet.
type: software
title: "OpenVeil: Detect, verify and mosaic people in video datasets before release, with an interactive human review tool"
abstract: >-
  OpenVeil helps researchers release video datasets that show people. It
  proposes person boxes with an open-vocabulary detector, verifies them with a
  fine-tuned crop classifier, lets a human check the hard cases in a local
  review tool, and mosaics the people while re-encoding only the parts of each
  video that contain a mosaic (smart cut).
